---

<BaseLayout
    title={pageTitle}
    description={pageDescription}
>
    <!-- Structured JSON-LD Schema Graph -->
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(pageSchema)} />

    <main class="dcrs-service-page">

        <!-- 1. HERO / OPENING ------------------------------------------------>
        <header class="dcrs-hero-banner">
            <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__scrim"></div>
            <div class="dcrs-container dcrs-hero-banner__inner">
                <nav class="dcrs-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                    <ol>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/#service">Services</a></li>
                        <li aria-current="page">Mobile Car Repair Dubai</li>
                    </ol>
                </nav>
                <span class="dcrs-badge">Central Dubai Dispatch · On-Site Assistance · Al Satwa Workshop Support</span>
                <h1 class="dcrs-hero-banner__title">
                    Mobile Car Repair Dubai - On-Site Mechanic Comes to You
                </h1>
                <p class="dcrs-hero-banner__lead">
                    Dealing with a dead battery, puncture, or unexpected breakdown? With our mobile car repair in Dubai, customers can request on-site assistance at selected locations across the city. Dispatched from our central Al Satwa workshop, our mobile technicians handle common roadside and driveway issues—including battery testing and replacement, jump starts, computer diagnostics, and minor repairs. For complex mechanical faults requiring lifting equipment or major teardown, we provide honest assessments and coordinate workshop transfer. Call-out from AED 30.
                </p>
                <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__actions">
                    <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call {phoneDisplay}
                    </a>
                    <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Us
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 2. SERVICE OVERVIEW ---------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="service-overview">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-grid-2col dcrs-grid-2col--align-center">
                    <div class="dcrs-intro-content">
                        <div class="dcrs-kicker">Service Overview</div>
                        <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">
                            Mobile Car Repair Dubai - Practical On-Site Mechanical Help
                        </h2>
                        <p class="dcrs-lead-text">
                            When your car experiences a sudden breakdown, starting trouble, or a warning light, driving to a garage may be impossible or unsafe. Mobile car repair provides practical assistance by sending a technician directly to your vehicle's location—whether in a residential driveway, office car park, or roadside bay. When you contact us, our team discusses the symptoms and parking access to determine whether the issue can be safely diagnosed and resolved on-site or if workshop repair is necessary.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            For eligible faults, our technicians carry portable diagnostic scanners, battery testers, jump-pack units, and essential hand tools directly from our central workshop on 222 Al Satwa Road. Common on-site services include <a href="/car-battery-replacement-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">mobile battery replacement</a>, emergency jump starts, puncture repairs, and electronic fault code scanning. If inspection indicates deeper issues—such as brake disc wear, transmission faults, or severe overheating—we advise you transparently and can arrange for vehicle transfer to our workshop for dedicated <a href="/car-engine-service-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">engine repair</a> or <a href="/car-maintenance-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">major vehicle servicing</a>.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            Mobile assistance is available across central Dubai districts, including Al Satwa, Jumeirah, Business Bay, Downtown, and surrounding areas, subject to technician availability and current traffic. Before dispatching a mechanic, we explain the applicable call-out fee and discuss initial pricing so you know what to expect. To request mobile assistance or confirm availability for your area, simply call us or share your location via WhatsApp.
                        </p>

                        <div class="dcrs-action-row">
                            <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call Mechanic
                            </a>
                            <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Location
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="dcrs-intro-visual">
                        <div class="dcrs-photo-card">
                            <img
                                src={service7Image.src}
                                alt="Technician conducting on-site mobile car repair in Dubai with mobile workshop equipment"
                                width="600"
                                height="400"
                                loading="eager"
                                class="dcrs-photo-card__img"
                            />
                            <div class="dcrs-photo-badge">
                                <div class="dcrs-photo-badge__value">AED 30</div>
                                <div class="dcrs-photo-badge__label">Call-Out Fee From</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. PRICING AND COST FACTORS -------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="pricing">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Fast and Affordable Pricing</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Mobile Car Repair Pricing &amp; Service Rates in Dubai</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        Transparent call-out rates and competitive service pricing. You approve a clear written quote on-site before any repair work starts.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-onsite-grid">
                    {onsiteServices.map((s) => (
                        <div class="dcrs-onsite-card">
                            <div class="dcrs-onsite-card__header">
                                <div class="dcrs-onsite-card__icon">
                                    <Fragment set:html={icons[s.icon]} />
                                </div>
                                <div class="dcrs-onsite-card__meta">
                                    <h3 class="dcrs-onsite-card__title">{s.title}</h3>
                                    <div class="dcrs-onsite-card__tags">
                                        <span class="dcrs-onsite-card__price">{s.price}</span>
                                        {s.mobileScope === 'yes' ? (
                                            <span class="dcrs-tag dcrs-tag--success">✓ Fully Mobile</span>
                                        ) : (
                                            <span class="dcrs-tag dcrs-tag--warning">Partial On-Site</span>
                                        )}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="dcrs-onsite-card__desc">{s.desc}</p>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>

                <p class="dcrs-pricing-disclaimer">
                    <Fragment set:html={icons.infoCircle} /> Note: Call-out fees start from AED 30 in central districts (Al Satwa, Jumeirah, Business Bay). Call-out covers travel and arrival; diagnostic scanning, labour, and replacement parts (such as batteries or filters) are itemised transparently for customer approval before work proceeds.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. SERVICE PROCESS ----------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="how-it-works">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">How It Works</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Our 4-Step On-Site Service Workflow</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        From your first call or WhatsApp pin to completed repair and testing - simple, clear, and professional.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-steps-grid">
                    {steps.map((st) => (
                        <div class="dcrs-step-card">
                            <span class="dcrs-step-card__num">{st.num}</span>
                            <h3 class="dcrs-step-card__title">{st.title}</h3>
                            <p class="dcrs-step-card__desc">{st.desc}</p>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. CAPABILITIES & BOUNDARIES ------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="capabilities">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Capabilities &amp; Boundaries</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">On-Site Services vs. Workshop Interventions</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        We believe in complete mechanical honesty. Here is what we handle on-site and what requires workshop lifting.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-workshop-box">
                    <div class="dcrs-workshop-box__header">
                        <span class="dcrs-workshop-box__icon">
                            <Fragment set:html={icons.alert} />
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="dcrs-workshop-box__title">
                            Repairs Requiring Our Al Satwa Workshop - Honest Advice First
                        </h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="dcrs-workshop-box__lead">
                        Certain automotive repairs cannot be carried out safely or reliably in a parking bay without heavy hydraulic lifts, precision torque rigs, or controlled cleanroom environments. Attempting complex structural or internal repairs roadside compromises safety. If your vehicle requires workshop intervention, we explain the reasons clearly and coordinate the transition with your approval.
                    </p>
                    <div class="dcrs-workshop-list">
                        {workshopRepairs.map((w) => (
                            <div class="dcrs-workshop-item">
                                <span class="dcrs-workshop-item__arrow">
                                    <Fragment set:html={icons.arrowRight} />
                                </span>
                                <span>{w}</span>
                            </div>
                        ))}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 6. COVERAGE & SERVICE LOCATIONS ---------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="coverage">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Coverage &amp; Locations</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Mobile Car Repair Service Locations in Dubai</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        Dispatched from our central Al Satwa workshop, serving drivers across central and surrounding Dubai communities.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-coverage-grid">
                    <div class="dcrs-coverage-card">
                        <h3 class="dcrs-coverage-card__title">Mobile Service Availability</h3>
                        <p class="dcrs-coverage-card__sub">
                            Mobile assistance is dispatched directly from our workshop at 222 Al Satwa Road. Response times vary based on current technician availability, the nature of the vehicle fault, and real-time traffic conditions across Dubai's road network. Priority is given to central areas close to our facility.
                        </p>
                        <div class="dcrs-callout-action">
                            <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> Share WhatsApp Location
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="dcrs-coverage-card">
                        <h3 class="dcrs-coverage-card__title">Central Communities We Frequently Attend</h3>
                        <p class="dcrs-coverage-card__sub">
                            We attend mobile call-outs across central and nearby Dubai communities, subject to scheduling:
                        </p>
                        <div class="dcrs-areas-tags">
                            {coverageAreas.map((area) => (
                                <span class="dcrs-area-tag">
                                    <Fragment set:html={icons.check} /> {area}
                                </span>
                            ))}
                        </div>
                        <p class="dcrs-coverage-note">
                            Need assistance outside these central areas? Share your location pin via WhatsApp to check current availability and travel estimates.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 7. WHY CHOOSE DUBAI CAR REPAIR SERVICE? -------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="why-choose-us">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Why Choose Us</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Why Dubai Drivers Trust Our Mobile Mechanics</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">12+ years of independent workshop experience, qualified mechanics, and transparent pricing.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-why-grid">
                    {whyChooseUs.map((r) => (
                        <div class="dcrs-why-card">
                            <span class="dcrs-why-card__icon">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons[r.icon]} />
                            </span>
                            <div>
                                <h3 class="dcrs-why-card__title">{r.title}</h3>
                                <p class="dcrs-why-card__desc">{r.desc}</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 8. FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ) ----------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="faq">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">FAQ</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Mobile Car Repair Dubai - Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-faq-accordion">
                    {faqs.map((faq, i) => (
                        <details class="dcrs-faq-item" open={i === 0}>
                            <summary class="dcrs-faq-item__question">
                                <span>{faq.q}</span>
                                <span class="dcrs-faq-item__toggle">
                                    <Fragment set:html={icons.chevronDown} />
                                </span>
                            </summary>
                            <div class="dcrs-faq-item__answer">
                                <p>{faq.a}</p>
                            </div>
                        </details>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 9. RELATED SERVICES ---------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="related-services">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">More Services</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Related Services You May Need</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-related-grid">
                    {relatedServices.map((r) => (
                        <a href={r.href} class="dcrs-related-card">
                            <span class="dcrs-related-card__icon">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons[r.icon]} />
                            </span>
                            <h3 class="dcrs-related-card__title">{r.name}</h3>
                            <p class="dcrs-related-card__desc">{r.desc}</p>
                        </a>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 10. FINAL CTA ---------------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-cta-banner">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-cta-banner__inner">
                    <div class="dcrs-cta-banner__copy">
                        <span class="dcrs-cta-banner__badge">Al Satwa Workshop &amp; Mobile Assistance</span>
                        <h2 class="dcrs-cta-banner__title">
                            Book Mobile Car Repair in Dubai
                        </h2>
                        <p class="dcrs-cta-banner__sub">
                            Contact our team with your vehicle details and location to confirm service availability, call-out charges, and estimated arrival time. Central Dubai call-outs from AED 30. Open daily 7:00 AM – 10:00 PM at 222 Al Satwa Road.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dcrs-cta-banner__actions">
                        <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                            <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call {phoneDisplay}
                        </a>
                        <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                            <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Us
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 11. BOTTOM STICKY MOBILE BAR ------------------------------------>
        <div class="dcrs-stickybar">
            <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid dcrs-stickybar__btn">
                <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call Now
            </a>
            <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid dcrs-stickybar__btn dcrs-stickybar__btn--wa">
                <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp
            </a>
        </div>

    </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    :root {
        --ink: #10201F;
        --ink-soft: #1B302E;
        --paper: #FAF8F5;
        --paper-alt: #f1f3f5;
        --white: #FFFFFF;
        --brass: #D48E33;
        --brass-deep: #9C6423;
        --steel: #444444;
        --rule-on-paper: rgba(16, 32, 31, 0.12);
        --rule-on-ink: rgba(251, 249, 244, 0.16);
    }

    .dcrs-service-page {
        padding-bottom: 0;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 100%;
        overflow-x: clip;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        background-color: var(--paper, #FAF8F5);
        color: var(--ink, #10201F);
    }

    .dcrs-container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1180px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 1.25rem;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .dcrs-container {
            padding: 0 0.85rem;
        }
    }

    /* Kicker & Typography */
    .dcrs-kicker {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--brass-deep);
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        background: rgba(193, 128, 46, 0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(193, 128, 46, 0.25);
        padding: 4px 10px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .dcrs-heading {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .dcrs-heading--center {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 680px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
    }

    .dcrs-heading__title {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 4.2vw, 2.35rem);
        line-height: 1.2;
        color: var(--ink);
        margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
        word-break: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }

    .dcrs-heading__sub {
        color: #666;
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
        word-break: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }

    .dcrs-lead-text {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--ink);
        margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
        word-break: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }

    .dcrs-body-text {
        font-size: 0.96rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: #555;
        margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
        word-break: break-word;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }

    .dcrs-inline-link {
        color: var(--brass-deep);
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }

    /* Section Wrappers */
    .dcrs-section {
        padding: clamp(3rem, 6.5vw, 5rem) 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .dcrs-section--paper { background: var(--paper, #FAF8F5); }
    .dcrs-section--tint { background: #f7f9fa; border-top: 1px solid #eef1f3; border-bottom: 1px solid #eef1f3; }

    /* Buttons */
    .dcrs-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.55rem;
        font-family: var(--font-body, sans-serif);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        text-decoration: none;
        line-height: 1;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
        min-height: 48px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .dcrs-btn :global(svg) {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .dcrs-btn--solid {
        background: var(--brass);
        color: var(--ink) !important;
    }
    .dcrs-btn--solid:hover {
        background: var(--brass-deep);
        color: #fff !important;
    }

    .dcrs-btn--wa {
        background: #25d366;
        color: #fff !important;
    }
    .dcrs-btn--wa:hover {
        background: #1ebc59;
    }

    .dcrs-action-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.85rem;
        margin-top: 1.75rem;
    }

    /* 1. Hero Banner */
    .dcrs-hero-banner {
        position: relative;
        background-color: var(--ink);
        color: #FBF9F4;
        padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem) 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        min-height: 500px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
        .dcrs-hero-banner {
            min-height: auto;
            padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4rem) 0;
        }
    }

    .dcrs-hero-banner .dcrs-container {
        width: 100%;
    }

    .dcrs-hero-banner__scrim {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(193, 128, 46, 0.15), transparent 50%);
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .dcrs-hero-banner__inner {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 820px;
    }

    .dcrs-breadcrumb ol {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        color: rgba(251, 249, 244, 0.65);
    }

    .dcrs-breadcrumb li + li::before {
        content: "/";
        margin-right: 0.5rem;
        color: rgba(251, 249, 244, 0.4);
    }

    .dcrs-breadcrumb a {
        color: rgba(251, 249, 244, 0.75);
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .dcrs-breadcrumb a:hover {
        color: var(--brass);
    }

    .dcrs-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--brass);
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .dcrs-hero-banner__title {
        font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 5.5vw, 2.9rem);
        line-height: 1.2;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
